+# Implementer Brief 13: Reopening View, Tab Sync, Motion Delta & Coat Colors
+
+## Required Edits
+
+### 1. `virtual_dog_walker/src/ui/social_hud.js`
+1. **Reopening Home Always Opens Sanctuary (when dog exists)**:
+   In `openModal()`:
+   When `modal.style.display === 'block'` and `this.dogSlot !== null`:
+   Always set `this.setHomeView('sanctuary');` (never keep stale `'settings'`).
+2. **Active Tab Synchronization**:
+   - In `_forceDogTab()`:
+     Set `this.activeTab = 'dog';`
+   - In `switchTab(tab)`:
+     Set `this.activeTab = tab;`
+   - In `bindEvents()` on `.customizer-tab-btn` click:
+     Set `this.activeTab = btn.getAttribute('data-tab') || (btn.id === 'tab-btn-dog' ? 'dog' : 'walker');`
+     And call `this.renderHomeStage();`
+
+### 2. `virtual_dog_walker/src/ui/home_sanctuary.js`
+1. **Sanctuary Motion Delta in Seconds**:
+   In `updateDog(dt)`:
+   Convert `dt` (milliseconds) to seconds:
+   `var step = WANDER_SPEED * (dt / 1000);`
+2. **`coatKey` Color Mapping**:
+   In `resolveAppearance(profile)`:
+   Support `profile.coatKey` or `dogSlot.coatKey`:
+   Map known coat keys to color pairs:
+   - `CHOCOLATE_TAN`: primary `#3e2723`, dark `#2b1712`, secondary `#d7ccc8`
+   - `GOLDEN`: primary `#eab308`, dark `#ca8a04`, secondary `#fef08a`
+   - `BLACK_LAB`: primary `#1e293b`, dark `#0f172a`, secondary `#475569`
+   - `BEAGLE`: primary `#b45309`, dark `#78350f`, secondary `#ffffff`
+   - `DALMATIAN`: primary `#f8fafc`, dark `#0f172a`, secondary `#0f172a`
+   Ensure `dog.coatColor` and `dog.coatColorDark` use these mapped colors so breed coat choices render accurately.
+
+### 3. `virtual_dog_walker/src/ui/home_feeding.js`
+1. In `updateDisabledState()`:
+   Ensure `#btn-action-feed` is disabled if `getDogSlot() === null` OR `!getCanvas()`.
+2. In `unmount()`:
+   If an in-flight `runFeed` promise resolver exists, invoke it so no dangling promises remain.
+
+### 4. Behavioral Tests
+- In `test/test_home_menu.py`:
+  - Test: existing dog -> open Home (sanctuary) -> switch to settings -> close modal -> open Home again -> verify `hud.currentHomeView === 'sanctuary'`.
+  - Test: after adopting dog, click Dogs tab -> verify `hud.activeTab === 'dog'` and `renderHomeStage` renders dog.
+- In `test/test_home_sanctuary.py`:
+  - Test: `updateDog` moves at plausible speed (`dt / 1000`).
+  - Test: `coatKey: 'GOLDEN'` produces golden coat color.
+
+## Verification
+Run:
+`python3 -m unittest test/test_home_sanctuary.py test/test_home_menu.py`
+All tests must pass (0 failures, 0 errors).
+
